cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "Historical bird plates: modern identifications"
abstract: >-
  Plate-by-plate modern identifications of historical bird folios (John Gould's
  The Birds of Europe, The Birds of Australia, The Birds of Great Britain and
  The Birds of Asia;
  Audubon's The Birds of America, Havell edition), with eBird,
  Wikidata, GBIF, Avibase and BirdNET identifiers, and cleaned public-domain images
  of the Gould plates.
authors:
  - family-names: Riley
    given-names: Wells
license: CC0-1.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/wr/historical-bird-plates"
keywords:
  - ornithology
  - natural history illustration
  - John Gould
  - John James Audubon
  - Biodiversity Heritage Library
  - taxonomy crosswalk
  - BirdNET
  - eBird
